">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.750" end="00:24.270"><span begin="00:21.750" end="00:21.900">It </span><span begin="00:21.900" end="00:22.080">was </span><span begin="00:22.080" end="00:22.680">February </span><span begin="00:22.680" end="00:23.280">fourteen</span><span begin="00:23.280" end="00:23.280">, </span><span begin="00:23.280" end="00:24.000">Valentine's </span><span begin="00:24.000" end="00:24.270">Day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.540" end="00:26.640"><span begin="00:24.540" end="00:24.750">The </span><span begin="00:24.750" end="00:25.080">roses </span><span begin="00:25.080" end="00:25.380">came</span><span begin="00:25.380" end="00:25.380">, </span><span begin="00:25.380" end="00:25.500">but </span><span begin="00:25.500" end="00:25.650">they </span><span begin="00:25.650" end="00:26.010">took </span><span begin="00:26.010" end="00:26.190">you </span><span begin="00:26.190" end="00:26.640">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.670" end="00:29.610"><span begin="00:26.670" end="00:27.210">Tattooed </span><span begin="00:27.210" end="00:27.330">on </span><span begin="00:27.330" end="00:27.480">my </span><span begin="00:27.480" end="00:27.810">arm </span><span begin="00:27.810" end="00:27.960">is </span><span begin="00:27.960" end="00:28.020">a </span><span begin="00:28.020" end="00:28.410">charm </span><span begin="00:28.410" end="00:28.560">to </span><span begin="00:28.560" end="00:29.040">disarm </span><span begin="00:29.040" end="00:29.160">all </span><span begin="00:29.160" end="00:29.250">the </span><span begin="00:29.250" end="00:29.610">harm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.610" end="00:32.460"><span begin="00:29.610" end="00:29.850">Gotta </span><span begin="00:29.850" end="00:30.060">keep </span><span begin="00:30.060" end="00:30.480">myself </span><span begin="00:30.480" end="00:30.810">calm </span><span begin="00:30.810" end="00:30.930">but </span><span begin="00:30.930" end="00:31.050">the </span><span begin="00:31.050" end="00:31.410">truth </span><span begin="00:31.410" end="00:31.560">is </span><span begin="00:31.560" end="00:31.740">you're </span><span begin="00:31.740" end="00:32.460">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.520" end="00:34.860"><span begin="00:32.520" end="00:32.760">And </span><span begin="00:32.760" end="00:32.820">I'll </span><span begin="00:32.820" end="00:33.120">never </span><span begin="00:33.120" end="00:33.300">get </span><span begin="00:33.300" end="00:33.420">to </span><span begin="00:33.420" end="00:33.630">show </span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:33.780">you </span><span begin="00:33.780" end="00:34.050">these </span><span begin="00:34.050" end="00:34.860">songs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.890" end="00:37.110"><span begin="00:34.890" end="00:35.250">Dad</span><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:35.250">, </span><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:35.370">you </span><span begin="00:35.370" end="00:35.550">should </span><span begin="00:35.550" end="00:35.730">see </span><span begin="00:35.730" end="00:35.820">the </span><span begin="00:35.820" end="00:36.240">tours </span><span begin="00:36.240" end="00:36.390">that </span><span begin="00:36.390" end="00:36.570">I'm </span><span begin="00:36.570" end="00:37.110">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.200" end="00:39.090"><span begin="00:37.200" end="00:37.320">I </span><span begin="00:37.320" end="00:37.530">see </span><span begin="00:37.530" end="00:37.620">you </span><span begin="00:37.620" end="00:38.010">standing </span><span begin="00:38.010" end="00:38.220">there </span><span begin="00:38.220" end="00:38.520">next </span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:38.670">to </span><span begin="00:38.670" end="00:39.090">Mom</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.120" end="00:41.880"><span begin="00:39.120" end="00:39.420">Both </span><span begin="00:39.420" end="00:39.780">singing </span><span begin="00:39.780" end="00:40.290">along</span><span begin="00:40.290" end